  "prefLabel": "Puc 203.04 Number of Copies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 203.04 Number of Copies. No paper filings shall be required if filed electronically. If the filing is not made electronically, then a single original paper filing shall be submitted pursuant to Puc 203.03(a).\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
